    <item>
      <title>Mezzanine 0.2.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:28:22 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>56</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; }
body { font: 13px/1.45 -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 10px 14px; }
ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 4px 0; } li { margin: 4px 0; }
h3 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0 4px; }
code { font: 12px ui-monospace, monospace; }
</style><ul>
<li>Mezzanine now updates itself: new versions download in the background and install when you quit. Settings ▸ Updates has the switches; Mezzanine ▸ Check for Updates… looks right away. An update never interrupts a film: it waits until the player closes.</li>
<li>Installs from a disk image (drag Mezzanine into Applications).</li>
<li>Google Cast: Play On picks This Mac or a TV; Cancel while connecting; Resume on This Mac or Try Again if the TV can&#x27;t play it.</li>
<li>Mini player, new-episode notifications, picture size (Fit, Fill, Zoom) and faster starts.</li>
<li>Full screen: the empty grey bar that sometimes stayed at the top after the menu bar slid in is gone.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
